      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Native Grid renderers for Swift (SwiftUI) and Kotlin…",
      "text": "Native Grid renderers for Swift (SwiftUI) and Kotlin (Jetpack Compose) were first published in alpha on 20 November 2026 from the public [NullDull SDK repository](https://github.com/doubco/nulldull-sdks). The current release, from 22 November 2026, is `NullDullGrid` and `NullDullGridUI` through Swift Package Manager at tag 0.3.0, and `com.nulldull:nulldull-grid-core` and `com.nulldull:nulldull-grid-compose` 0.2.0 on Maven Central.",
      "assetId": null,
