      "kind": "text",
      "name": "They are tested against the same layout goldens as the web…",
      "text": "They are tested against the same layout goldens as the web renderer, and have been run on iPhone, macOS and Android phone and tablet emulators. We will verify them on iPad, tvOS, visionOS and the oldest supported versions and keep closing the parity gaps listed in the developer docs before calling them stable.",
